# Playwright - Complete Notes & Theory

## Executive Overview

Playwright is a **modern browser automation and testing framework** that allows developers and QA teams to automate web application testing across multiple browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari) and platforms.

**Key Characteristics:**
- ✓ Multi-browser support (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
- ✓ Cross-platform (Windows, Mac, Linux)
- ✓ Multiple programming languages (JavaScript/TypeScript, Python, Java, C#)
- ✓ Fast and reliable
- ✓ Built-in testing capabilities
- ✓ Headless and headed modes
- ✓ Network interception and mocking
- ✓ Screenshots and video recording

