### CONCEPT 7: Screenshot & Video Recording

**Theory:**
Visual debugging helps understand what happened during test execution. Screenshots and videos are essential for debugging.

```
Debug Information Hierarchy:

Most Detailed:
    │
    ├─ Trace Files (DevTools trace)
    │   └─ Network, DOM, inputs, screenshots over time
    │
    ├─ Video Recording
    │   └─ Full video of test execution
    │
    ├─ Screenshots
    │   └─ Single frame image
    │
    └─ Error Messages
        └─ Text descriptions

Best Practice: Use all three!
```

**Practical Example:**

